# Dietitian Project Context

- White-label dietitian web application platform.
- Architecture: Strapi v5 Headless CMS (`/backend`) + Next.js App Router with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS (`/frontend`).
- Keep solutions suitable for non-technical dietitians managing content in Strapi.
- Prefer clinical, clean UX (emerald, teal, slate) across the product.
